think Three moves in the close, each proven on metal. (1) vols_survey_witness.rish — the survey-of-itself, the 79th prose gap — its pedagogical "lap 3"/"lap 5" doc-comment examples reworded to a "lap <N>" placeholder (teaching the drift shape without a real digit), and its boundary grep changed from 'lap 5' to 'lap [0-9]' (still counts the testimony fixture's real ordinal, which correctly keeps it) — the witness re-runs GREEN, teaching intact, and added to the guard as a clean surface.
think (2) REDS #74 fixed: vols_guardlist_extract.sh's filter widened from rye|md|brix to rye|md|brix|rish|glow — the extensions the guard actually scans — so the extracted guardlist stopped silently dropping every .rish (and the one .glow) guarded site. The two measures now agree: the guardlist holds all 79 of 79 VOLS prose-gap paths.
think (3) Re-running the live census surfaced a subtlety the toolchain earned: the guard witness ITSELF (cion_module_labeling_witness.rish) was the one remaining site — its before→after changelog quotes retired ordinals to document each relabel. Rather than exempt it (a guard that skips itself is weaker than one that obeys itself), reworded the biting quotes to a "lap <N>" placeholder (capability names and mappings kept, the biting digit gone) and added it to its own scan list. The labeling guard now obeys the law it enforces, scanning itself.
obs The close is proven three ways: the CION guard runs GREEN over the full widened set including itself (planted-negative fixture still bites); the live classify reports sites=144 handles=144 prose_gaps=0 guarded_sites=0 verdict=ok (every one of the 79 prose gaps fell out as a site once relabeled, only kept witness handles remain); and coverage reads all 79 of 79 ledger prose-gap paths in the extracted guardlist (guardlist 109 entries). The VOLS read-true witness stays GREEN.
obs Left the seated VOLS ledger work-in-progress/vols-survey-ledger.bron untouched — it is a dated snapshot (stamp 20260812.221045) recording FUSS's pre-molt worklist (223 sites, 79 prose gaps); accrete-never-break and the one-clock law keep it. The post-molt state (prose_gaps=0) is provable by re-running the classify and is recorded in the guard witness's own census and here.
obs No tame_style_check / width-check needed — the changed files are .rish and .sh, not authored .rye. All three changed files valid UTF-8. REDS.md 22527 B under its 24576 bound; the reds-monotone witness GREEN.
